WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.900
Since our first breath,
humanity fought for sheer survival.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:09.500
Watering holes, caves,
and tribal blood feuds.

3
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:16.000
Empires rose, hungering for metals,
slaves, and imperial glory.

4
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:19.500
Marching millions
into phalanx slaughter.

5
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:25.500
Feudal lords and divine claims turned land
into permanent battlefields...

6
00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.500
...of sieges, arrows,
and sacred blood.

7
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:34.000
Industrial machines
birthed mass conscription.

8
00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:38.500
We weaponized steam and steel
to capture coal and iron.

9
00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.800
National glory demanded
total industrial annihilation.

10
00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:49.500
Driven by toxic ideologies and oil,
we industrialized death itself.

11
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:54.500
Locked in the shadow
of mutual nuclear suicide...

12
00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:59.500
...superpowers carved the planet
through brutal shadow proxy wars.

13
00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:04.500
Today's gray-zone chaos.
Weaponized data, critical minerals...

14
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:09.500
...and killer drones
dominating modern skies.

15
00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:15.000
Drying river basins
and chip supply choke points...

16
00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:18.500
...trigger machine-speed hyperwar
and automated swarm strikes.

17
00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:25.000
This is where the trajectory leads.
Extinction.

18
00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:29.000
Unless...
we rewind it.

19
00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:38.500
Open Networked Earth replaces artificial borders
with living fluvial watersheds.

20
00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:43.500
Compound debt replaced by
thermodynamic physical balance.

21
00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:50.200
No oligarchs. Governance returned to the people
through demarchic sortition.

22
00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:55.000
Everyday citizens chosen by lot
to steward the commons.

23
00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:58.500
Do not protest. Build.

24
00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:03.000
Together with the machines,
dismantle the incentives for war.

25
00:02:03.500 --> 00:02:05.500
Build the commons.

26
00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:09.500
Download the blueprints at
one-commons.github.io
